  "description": "<p>The fcr:fixity endpoint responds oddly to invalid request methods. Generally the results are errors, but not expected ones.</p>\n\n<p>PUT to existing binary (would probably expect a 405 and related message)</p>\n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\">\r\ncurl -ufedoraAdmin:fedoraAdmin -XPUT http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//localhost:8080/<span class=\"code-keyword\">rest</span>/binary_with_sha1/fcr:fixity\r\n</span>\r\n# HTTP/1.1 409 Conflict\r\n\r\n# NonRdfSource resources cannot contain other resources\r\n</pre>\n</div></div>\n<p>PATCH or DELETE (would expect a 405)</p>\n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\">\r\ncurl -ufedoraAdmin:fedoraAdmin -XPATCH http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//localhost:8080/<span class=\"code-keyword\">rest</span>/binary_with_sha1/fcr:fixity\r\n</span>\r\n# HTTP/1.1 404 Not Found\r\n# Error: No OCFL mapping found <span class=\"code-keyword\">for</span> info:fedora/binary_with_sha1/fcr:fixity\r\n</pre>\n</div></div>\n<p>HEAD (would expect a 405)</p>\n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\">\r\ncurl -ufedoraAdmin:fedoraAdmin -I http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//localhost:8080/<span class=\"code-keyword\">rest</span>/binary_with_sha1/fcr:fixity -v\r\n</span>\r\n# HTTP/1.1 200 OK\r\n</pre>\n</div></div>\n<p>Request to fcr:fixity of a resource that doesn't exist</p>\n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\">\r\ncurl -ufedoraAdmin:fedoraAdmin -XPUT http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//localhost:8080/<span class=\"code-keyword\">rest</span>/doesnotexist/fcr:fixity\r\n</span># HTTP/1.1 201 Created\r\n\r\n\r\ncurl -ufedoraAdmin:fedoraAdmin http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//localhost:8080/<span class=\"code-keyword\">rest</span>/doesnotexist/fcr:fixity\r\n</span># 404\r\n# Error: No OCFL mapping found <span class=\"code-keyword\">for</span> info:fedora/doesnotexist\r\n\r\ncurl -ufedoraAdmin:fedoraAdmin http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//localhost:8080/<span class=\"code-keyword\">rest</span>/doesnotexist\r\n</span># 404\r\n# Error: No OCFL mapping found <span class=\"code-keyword\">for</span> info:fedora/doesnotexist\r\n\r\n# Try to create <span class=\"code-quote\">\"doesnotexist\"</span> via POST, thinks the ID is taken\r\ncurl -ufedoraAdmin:fedoraAdmin -XPOST http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//localhost:8080/<span class=\"code-keyword\">rest</span>/ -H<span class=\"code-quote\">\"Slug: doesnotexist\"</span>\r\n</span># http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//localhost:8080/<span class=\"code-keyword\">rest</span>/3cedc11e-e8f8-4c77-91a7-ad50f230078c</span></pre>\n</div></div>\n<p>PUT to fcr:fixity of an existing non-binary resource</p>\n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\">\r\ncurl -ufedoraAdmin:fedoraAdmin -XPUT http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//localhost:8080/<span class=\"code-keyword\">rest</span>/helloworld\r\n</span>\r\ncurl -ufedoraAdmin:fedoraAdmin http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//localhost:8080/<span class=\"code-keyword\">rest</span>/helloworld/fcr:fixity -v\r\n</span># HTTP/1.1 404 Not Found\r\n# org.fcrepo.kernel.impl.models.ContainerImpl@69dd2e29 is not a binary\r\n\r\n</pre>\n</div></div>",
